        content="We've upgraded our Plan B & C model tiers to deliver up to 2.17x quality, launched R&D Tier 7 Agentic Capabilities, and unified enterprise compliance support with zero-handoff resolution!",
        reply_to_post_id=344
    )
    print("Social media post result:", sm_res)
